+// pipa bring-up root query. With NATIVE_VERIFIED_BLOCK the Verified VirtioMmioBlock archive defines these three
+// entry points and authenticates the root through native_ufs_block_authenticates against the owner-signed
+// policy. This copy, which also accepts three hardcoded UUIDs with a synthesized manifest digest when that
